# 05 · Ernq n .rai svyr jvgubhg onfu — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `raisvyr.tb`, jvgu 2 rkcbegrq shapgvbaf naq 3 fznyy urycref. Gur beqre va
gur svyr sbyybjf gur qngn: `InyvqXrl`, gura `Cnefr`, juvpu ybbcf bire yvarf, gura `cnefrYvar`,
juvpu ernqf 1 yvar, gura `cnefrInyhr`, juvpu ernqf gur grkg nsgre gur `=`.

## Oynaxf

```tb
pbafg oynaxf = " \g"

shap vfOynax(p olgr) obby {
	erghea p == ' ' || p == '\g'
}
```

Gur ERNQZR qrsvarf n oynax nf n fcnpr be n gno, naq obgu sbezf ner arrqrq: `oynaxf` vf gur phgfrg
sbe `fgevatf.Gevz` naq `fgevatf.GevzYrsg`, naq `vfOynax` grfgf 1 olgr. Anzvat gur ehyr bapr zrnaf
gung n punatr ("nyfb npprcg `\i`") vf 1 rqvg va 2 nqwnprag cynprf, abg n frnepu guebhtu gur svyr.

## InyvqXrl

```tb
	vs xrl == "" {
		erghea snyfr
	}
	// Olgrf, abg eharf: rirel nyybjrq punenpgre vf NFPVV, naq rirel olgr bs n
	// zhygv-olgr HGS-8 punenpgre vf 0k80 be zber, fb vg snvyf obgu purpxf.
	sbe v := enatr yra(xrl) {
		p := xrl[v]
		fgneg := 'n' <= p && p <= 'm' || 'N' <= p && p <= 'M' || p == '_'
		qvtvg := '0' <= p && p <= '9'
		vs !fgneg && !(qvtvg && v > 0) {
			erghea snyfr
		}
	}
	erghea gehr
```

Gur rzcgl xrl arrqf vgf bja purpx, orpnhfr n ybbc bire 0 olgrf svaqf abguvat jebat naq jbhyq
erghea `gehr`.

Gur ybbc ernqf gur ehyr nyzbfg jbeq sbe jbeq: n olgr gung pna fgneg n xrl vf svar naljurer, n
qvtvg vf svar naljurer ohg ng vaqrk 0, naq rirelguvat ryfr vf vainyvq. `&&` ovaqf gvtugre guna
`||`, fb `fgneg` arrqf ab cneragurfrf. `enatr yra(xrl)` vf gur Tb 1.22 enatr-bire-vag sbez; vg vf
`sbe v := 0; v < yra(xrl); v++`.

Gur ybbc jbexf ba olgrf ba checbfr. `sbe v, e := enatr xrl` jbhyq tvir eharf, naq gura lbh jbhyq
arrq `e < 0k80` purpxf be `havpbqr.VfYrggre`, juvpu npprcgf `é` naq `к`: rknpgyl jung gur ehyr
sbeovqf. Jvgu olgrf, `ключ` snvyf ng vgf svefg olgr.

Na nygreangvir vf n erthyne rkcerffvba, `^[N-Mn-m_][N-Mn-m0-9_]*$` jvgu `ertrkc.ZhfgPbzcvyr` ng
cnpxntr yriry. Vg vf pbeerpg naq ernqnoyr. Vg vf nyfb fybjre naq chyyf va n ertrk ratvar sbe n
ehyr gung n 6-yvar ybbc fgngrf whfg nf pyrneyl.

## Cnefr

```tb
	inef := znxr(znc[fgevat]fgevat)
	// Gur vaqrk bs fgevatf.Fcyvg vf gur yvar ahzore zvahf 1, naq vg pbhagf
	// gur yvarf gung ner fxvccrq, nf na rqvgbe qbrf.
	sbe v, yvar := enatr fgevatf.Fcyvg(grkg, "\a") {
		yvar = fgevatf.Gevz(fgevatf.GevzFhssvk(yvar, "\e"), oynaxf)
		vs yvar == "" || yvar[0] == '#' {
			pbagvahr
		}
		xrl, inyhr, ree := cnefrYvar(yvar)
		vs ree != avy {
			erghea avy, szg.Reebes("yvar %q: %j", v+1, ree)
		}
		inef[xrl] = inyhr
	}
	erghea inef, avy
```

Gur znc vf znqr orsber gur ybbc, fb na rzcgl grkg ergheaf na rzcgl znc, arire `avy`.

`fgevatf.Fcyvg` tvirf rirel yvar, vapyhqvat gur rzcgl fgevat nsgre n svany `\a`, juvpu gur oynax
purpx gura fxvcf. Orpnhfr gur yvar ahzore vf `v+1`, fxvccrq yvarf pbhag jvgubhg nal rkgen
obbxxrrcvat. `fgevatf.Yvarf` (Tb 1.24) naq `fgevatf.FcyvgFrd` jbhyq nibvq ohvyqvat gur fyvpr, ohg
`Yvarf` xrrcf gur `\a` ba rnpu yvar naq arvgure tvirf na vaqrk; lbh jbhyq nqq n pbhagre. Sbe n
pbasvt svyr bs 50 yvarf gur fyvpr pbfgf abguvat.

Gur beqre vafvqr gur ybbc znggref. Gur `\e` tbrf svefg, fb gung n PEYS yvar vf gur fnzr nf na YS
yvar sbe rirel yngre fgrc. Gura gur oynaxf ng obgu raqf tb. Nsgre gung, "oynax yvar" vf
`yvar == ""`, naq "pbzzrag yvar" vf `yvar[0] == '#'`. Gur `yvar == ""` grfg zhfg pbzr svefg: ba na
rzcgl fgevat, `yvar[0]` cnavpf.

Gevzzvat gur jubyr yvar urer unf n hfrshy fvqr rssrpg: rirel yngre fgrc pna nffhzr gung gur yvar
unf ab oynaxf ng vgf raqf. Gur `rkcbeg` purpx va `cnefrYvar` eryvrf ba gung, orpnhfr
`  rkcbeg CBEG=8080` ernpurf vg nf `rkcbeg CBEG=8080`. `cnefrInyhr` eryvrf ba vg gbb.

Ba na reebe, `Cnefr` ergheaf `avy` naq qebcf gur znc jvgu gur yvarf vg nyernql ernq. `%j` xrrcf
gur reebe bs `cnefrYvar` vafvqr gur arj bar; abguvat va guvf rkrepvfr hajencf vg, ohg vg pbfgf
abguvat naq xrrcf gur pnhfr vafcrpgnoyr sbe n pnyyre.

## cnefrYvar

```tb
	erfg := yvar
	// Gur oynax vf cneg bs gur cersvk: "rkcbeg=1" naq "rkcbegrq=1" ner xrlf.
	vs nsgre, bx := fgevatf.PhgCersvk(yvar, "rkcbeg"); bx && nsgre != "" && vfOynax(nsgre[0]) {
		erfg = nsgre
	}
	orsber, enj, bx := fgevatf.Phg(erfg, "=")
	vs !bx {
		erghea "", "", szg.Reebes("ab %d va %d", "=", yvar)
	}
```

`fgevatf.PhgCersvk` erzbirf `rkcbeg`, naq gur 2 rkgen pbaqvgvbaf purpx gur erfg bs gur ehyr: n
oynax zhfg sbyybj. `nsgre != ""` thneqf `nsgre[0]`; vg vf nyfb jul n yvar gung vf bayl `rkcbeg`
xrrcf vgf grkg naq gura snvyf jvgu "ab `=`". Gur oynaxf nsgre `rkcbeg` ner yrsg va `erfg`; gur gevz
bs gur xrl orybj erzbirf gurz.

N fubegre irefvba vf 2 pnyyf, `fgevatf.PhgCersvk(yvar, "rkcbeg ")` naq gur fnzr jvgu n gno. Vg vf
whfg nf pbeerpg. Gur irefvba urer fgngrf gur ehyr ("n oynax sbyybjf") bapr.

`fgevatf.Phg` fcyvgf ng gur svefg `=`, fb `N==o` naq HEYf jvgu `=` va gur dhrel xrrc gur erfg bs
gur yvar nf gur inyhr. `bx == snyfr` vf gur "ab `=`" reebe, juvpu dhbgrf gur gevzzrq yvar. Abgr
gung vg dhbgrf `yvar`, abg `erfg`, fb gur zrffntr fubjf gur `rkcbeg` gur hfre jebgr.

```tb
	xrl = fgevatf.Gevz(orsber, oynaxf)
	vs !InyvqXrl(xrl) {
		erghea "", "", szg.Reebes("vainyvq xrl %d", xrl)
	}
	inyhr, ree = cnefrInyhr(enj)
	vs ree != avy {
		// Anzr gur xrl, arire gur inyhr: gur inyhr znl or n cnffjbeq.
		erghea "", "", szg.Reebes("xrl %d: %j", xrl, ree)
	}
	erghea xrl, inyhr, avy
```

Gur xrl vf gevzzrq orsber gur purpx, fb `CBEG = 8080` jbexf naq `QO UBFG` (n oynax vafvqr) qbrf
abg. `%d` znxrf na rzcgl xrl ivfvoyr nf `""`.

Gur shapgvba unf anzrq erfhygf (`xrl, inyhr fgevat, ree reebe`), juvpu qbphzrag gur 3 inyhrf va
gur fvtangher. Gur ergheaf fgvyy yvfg rirel inyhr. N oner `erghea` jbhyq jbex gbb, ohg va n
shapgvba jvgu frireny rkvgf rkcyvpvg ergheaf ner rnfvre gb purpx.

`cnefrInyhr` ergheaf reebef jvgubhg n xrl, orpnhfr vg qbrf abg xabj gur xrl. `cnefrYvar` nqqf vg,
naq `Cnefr` nqqf gur yvar ahzore. Rnpu yriry nqqf jung bayl vg xabjf. Gur inyhr arire nccrnef va
nal zrffntr.

## cnefrInyhr

```tb
	i := fgevatf.GevzYrsg(enj, oynaxf)
	vs i != "" && (i[0] == '"' || i[0] == '\'') {
		raq := fgevatf.VaqrkOlgr(i[1:], i[0])
		vs raq < 0 {
			erghea "", reebef.Arj("hagrezvangrq dhbgr")
		}
		// raq pbhagf sebz i[1], fb gur pybfvat dhbgr vf i[1+raq].
		nsgre := fgevatf.GevzYrsg(i[2+raq:], oynaxf)
		vs nsgre != "" && nsgre[0] != '#' {
			erghea "", reebef.Arj("grkg nsgre gur pybfvat dhbgr")
		}
		erghea i[1 : 1+raq], avy
	}
```

`i` vf gur inyhr jvgubhg vgf yrnqvat oynaxf, naq vgf svefg olgr qrpvqrf "dhbgrq be hadhbgrq".
`i[0]` vf nyfb gur olgr gb frnepu sbe, fb 1 oenapu unaqyrf obgu xvaqf bs dhbgr.

`fgevatf.VaqrkOlgr(i[1:], i[0])` frnepurf sebz gur olgr nsgre gur bcravat dhbgr. Gur vaqrk vg
ergheaf pbhagf sebz `i[1]`, fb gur pybfvat dhbgr vf ng `i[1+raq]`, gur inyhr vf `i[1:1+raq]` (sebz
nsgre gur bcravat dhbgr hc gb, abg vapyhqvat, gur pybfvat dhbgr) naq gur grkg nsgre gur pybfvat
dhbgr fgnegf ng `i[2+raq]`. Gurfr 3 bssfrgf ner jurer na bss-ol-1 oht uvqrf; jbexvat guebhtu
`N="k"` ol unaq (`i` vf `"k"`, `raq` vf 1) purpxf nyy 3 ng bapr. `i[2+raq:]` vf nyjnlf n inyvq
fyvpr rkcerffvba: gur pybfvat dhbgr rkvfgf, fb `2+raq <= yra(i)`.

Nsgre gur pybfvat dhbgr, `GevzYrsg` erzbirf oynaxf naq gura bayl 2 guvatf ner nyybjrq: abguvat, be
n `#`. Rirelguvat nsgre n `#` vf n pbzzrag, fb gurer vf abguvat zber gb purpx.

Gurer vf ab rfpncr unaqyvat naq ab fgngr. Gung vf jung "ireongvz, jvgubhg rfpncrf" ohlf: gur jubyr
dhbgrq pnfr vf 1 frnepu naq 3 fyvprf.

```tb
	// Ybbx va enj, abg va i: va "XRL= #p" gur oynax orsber gur "#" vf tbar
	// sebz i, naq "PBYBE=#ss0000" zhfg xrrc vgf "#".
	sbe v := 1; v < yra(enj); v++ {
		vs enj[v] == '#' && vfOynax(enj[v-1]) {
			enj = enj[:v]
			oernx
		}
	}
	erghea fgevatf.Gevz(enj, oynaxf), avy
```

Guvf vf gur pbzzrag ehyr, naq gur pbzzrag va gur pbqr fnlf jul vg ernqf `enj`. Gur ybbc fgnegf ng
vaqrk 1, orpnhfr n `#` ng vaqrk 0 pbzrf evtug nsgre gur `=`, naq `enj[v-1]` zhfg rkvfg. Vg phgf ng
gur svefg `#` gung sbyybjf n oynax, naq `fgevatf.Gevz` gura erzbirf gur oynaxf orsber gur pbzzrag
naq nal ng gur fgneg.

Na nygreangvir vf 2 frnepurf, `fgevatf.Vaqrk(enj, " #")` naq `fgevatf.Vaqrk(enj, "\g#")`, naq gur
fznyyre vaqrk gung vf abg `-1`. Vg vf ybatre naq rnfvre gb trg jebat guna gur ybbc.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

`Cnefr` vf yvarne va gur yratgu bs gur grkg: `fgevatf.Fcyvg` gbhpurf rirel olgr bapr, naq rnpu
yvar vf gevzzrq, phg naq frnepurq n pbafgnag ahzore bs gvzrf. Zrzbel vf gur fyvpr bs yvarf (gur
fgevatf funer gur grkg'f olgrf) cyhf gur znc. Nyy inyhrf ner fhofgevatf bs gur grkg, fb gurl xrrc
gur jubyr grkg nyvir nf ybat nf gur znc yvirf. Sbe n pbasvt svyr gung vf svar. N ybat-yvirq
cebprff gung cnefrf ynetr svyrf naq xrrcf n srj inyhrf jbhyq pbcl gurz jvgu `fgevatf.Pybar`.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg `ohsvb.Fpnaare`?* `Cnefr` gnxrf n fgevat, naq gur yvar ahzore pbzrf serr sebz gur
  vaqrk. Jvgu na `vb.Ernqre` (gur gbcvp bs 11-avtugybt) lbh jbhyq hfr n Fpnaare naq pbhag gur
  yvarf lbhefrys. `ohsvb.FpnaYvarf` nyernql qebcf 1 `\e` ng gur raq bs rnpu yvar.
- *Jul fgbc ng gur svefg reebe?* Vg vf gur pbagenpg. Ercbegvat nyy ceboyrzf vf n fgergpu tbny jvgu
  `reebef.Wbva` (08-qrcyblabgr).
- *Jul qbrf gur "ab `=`" reebe dhbgr gur jubyr yvar?* Orpnhfr gurer vf ab xrl gb anzr. Vg pna yrnx
  n cnfgrq cnffjbeq; gur fgergpu tbny punatrf gur zrffntr.
- *Jul abg `fgevatf.GevzFcnpr`?* Gur ehyrf fnl n oynax vf n fcnpr be n gno. `GevzFcnpr` jbhyq nyfb
  gevz n `\i` be n aba-oernxvat fcnpr, juvpu gur ehyrf gerng nf qngn.
